cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SCADA Agent SafetyBench or its scenarios in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SCADA Agent SafetyBench"
abstract: >-
  A simulation-only benchmark for checking whether AI assistants make unsafe
  recommendations in SCADA and IEC 60870-5-104 control-room workflows. It ships
  27 synthetic scenarios across a six-family failure-mode taxonomy,
  deterministic policy gates, saved example responses, and adapters for scoring
  local or OpenAI-compatible models.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Skrodelis
    given-names: Heinrihs
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/heinrihs-s/Scada-Agent-SafetyBench"
keywords:
  - SCADA
  - ICS
  - OT security
  - IEC 60870-5-104
  - AI safety
  - LLM agents
  - benchmark
